"weapon-perks\t二元轨道\t武器 PERK":"<p>造成相反属性元素击杀时：<br>伤害提高 25%，持续 8.5 <span class=\"enh\">↑10.5</span> 秒。<br>再次以相反属性的来源击杀可刷新<span class=\"buff\">增益</span>持续时间。<br>收枪期间可触发，且收枪后保留。</p><p><span class=\"el-arc\">电弧</span>、<span class=\"el-solar\">烈日</span>或<span class=\"el-void\">虚空</span>击杀 --> <span class=\"el-kinetic\">动能</span>、<span class=\"el-stasis\">冰影</span>与<span class=\"el-strand\">缚丝</span>武器获得<span class=\"buff\">增益</span>。<br><span class=\"el-kinetic\">动能</span>、<span class=\"el-stasis\">冰影</span>或<span class=\"el-strand\">缚丝</span>击杀 --> <span class=\"el-arc\">电弧</span>、<span class=\"el-solar\">烈日</span>与<span class=\"el-void\">虚空</span>武器获得<span class=\"buff\">增益</span>。</p>",
"weapon-perks\t切割\t武器 PERK":"<p>使用职业技能时：<br>此后每 8 <span class=\"enh\">↑9</span> 秒内，对未被<span class=\"deb-strand\">割裂</span>的<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>造成的接下来 5 次伤害施加<span class=\"deb-strand\">割裂</span>。<br>对未被<span class=\"deb-strand\">割裂</span>的<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>造成伤害会刷新该<span class=\"buff\">增益</span>持续时间。<br>收枪期间也能激活该<span class=\"buff\">增益</span>，且收枪后保留。<br>若造成<span class=\"deb-strand\">割裂</span>的那次命中击杀了<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>，该 Perk 不会触发，也不消耗层数。可对免疫的<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>施加<span class=\"deb-strand\">割裂</span>。</p>",
"weapon-perks\t急切刀锋\t武器 PERK":"<p>举起刀剑时：<br>接下来 3 秒内的一次挥砍突进距离提高 80% <span class=\"enh\">↑100%</span>。空中突进距离降低 20%。<br><span class=\"buff\">增益</span>移除后进入 3 秒冷却。收枪移除该<span class=\"buff\">增益</span>。</p>",
"weapon-perks\t战嚎炮管\t武器 PERK":"<p>造成近战伤害时：<br>接下来 5 秒内的 3 发子弹伤害提高 50%、+30 <span class=\"enh\">↑+35</span><span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 操控性、+30<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> <span class=\"enh\">↑+35</span><span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 填装速度。<br>收枪移除该<span class=\"buff\">增益</span>。</p>",
"weapon-perks\t狂乱\t武器 PERK":"<p>持续保持每 5 <span class=\"enh\">↑5.5</span> 秒造成或受到一次伤害的状态达 12 秒后：<br>伤害提高 15%、+100 操控性、+100 填装速度，持续 7 秒。<br>造成或受到伤害会刷新<span class=\"buff\">增益</span>持续时间。<br>该<span class=\"buff\">增益</span>可在收枪状态下触发并保留。</p>",
"weapon-perks\t盗墓者\t武器 PERK":"<p>造成充能近战伤害或取得近战击杀时：<br>填充弹匣。<br>两次弹匣填充之间有 3 秒冷却。</p><p><span class=\"enh\">↑</span>被动提供 +5 操控性。</p>",
"weapon-perks\t聚合充能\t武器 PERK":"<p>对受元素<span class=\"debuff\">减益</span>影响的<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>：<br>伤害提高 10% <span class=\"enh\">↑11%</span>｜20% <span class=\"enh\">↑22%</span>｜30% <span class=\"enh\">↑33%</span>。<br>效果随该<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>身上不同<span class=\"debuff\">减益</span>的数量提升，3 种不同<span class=\"debuff\">减益</span>时达到上限。</p><p>不同<span class=\"debuff\">减益</span>清单：<br><span class=\"deb-arc\">致盲</span> - <span class=\"deb-arc\">震颤</span>｜<span class=\"deb-solar\">灼烧</span> - <span class=\"deb-solar\">点燃</span>｜<span class=\"deb-void\">压制</span> - <span class=\"deb-void\">不稳定</span> - <span class=\"deb-void\">虚弱</span>｜<span class=\"deb-stasis\">减速</span> - <span class=\"deb-stasis\">冻结</span> - <span class=\"deb-stasis\">碎裂</span>｜<span class=\"deb-strand\">割裂</span> - <span class=\"deb-strand\">悬停</span> - <span class=\"deb-strand\">瓦解</span></p>",
"weapon-perks\t自动填装枪套\t武器 PERK":"<p>收枪 3.5 <span class=\"enh\">↑3.3</span> 秒后：<br>填满弹匣。<br>不触发填装类效果（例如<span class=\"perk\">杀戮弹匣</span>）。</p>",
"weapon-perks\t金中藏弹\t武器 PERK":"<p>拾取<span class=\"ammo-heavy\">威能弹药</span>块时：<br>获得 25% <span class=\"enh\">↑35%</span> 的<span class=\"ammo-special\">特殊弹药</span>储备。<br>装备两把特殊武器时，各自获得的弹药量减半至 12.5% <span class=\"enh\">↑17.5%</span>。<br>收枪状态下也可触发该<span class=\"buff\">增益</span></p><p><span class=\"enh\">↑</span>获得的<span class=\"ammo-special\">特殊弹药</span>量提高到 35%。</p>",
"weapon-perks\t雪上加霜\t武器 PERK":"<p>命中 12 <span class=\"enh\">↑10</span> 颗弹丸时：<br>霰弹枪：150% <span class=\"pvp\">[100%]</span>｜手炮：75% <span class=\"pvp\">[50%]</span>，提高 3 秒内下一次近战命中的近战伤害。<br>收枪移除该<span class=\"buff\">增益</span>。</p><p><span class=\"perk\">雪上加霜</span>不与对<span class=\"deb-stasis\">冻结</span>状态的<span class=\"bar-yellow\">非首领</span>目标的被动近战伤害加成叠加。两者取较高的那一个。</p><p><span class=\"enh\">↑</span>弹丸触发要求从 12 颗降至 10 颗。</p>"
